#: ../../source/predictive_charts.md:34
msgid "`target_year` — calendar year (int) in which to find the solar return"
msgstr "`target_year` — année calendaire (int) dans laquelle trouver le retour solaire"

#: ../../source/predictive_charts.md:35
msgid ""
"`return_lat`, `return_lon` — relocation coordinates (see below); default "
