#: ../../source/predictive_charts.md:73
msgid ""
"`return_lat`, `return_lon` — relocation coordinates; default `None` = "
"natal location"
msgstr ""
"`return_lat`, `return_lon` — coordonnées de relocalisation ; défaut `None` "
